  "eng-zh-011": "The MTBM cutterhead rotation speed is 6 rpm."
}

{
  "eng-zh-013": "During MTBM tunneling, attitude, earth pressure, and mud flow rate shall be monitored continuously."
}

{
  "eng-zh-014": "When the torque of the cutterhead abnormally increases, advance shall be stopped, and the cutters and spoil-removal system shall be inspected before resuming operations."
}

{
  "eng-zh-015": "The top pipe jacking working shaft and reception shaft shall complete structural acceptance before equipment enters the shaft. The guide rail centerline, reaction wall bearing capacity, slurry piping, and emergency stop circuit must be recorded in the equipment launch inspection sheet."
}
